@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Proof-qualified semantic expression flow

rectangle "Immutable CPG + function CFG\nlive typed ExpressionIr roots" as Input #D0EBFF
rectangle "Admission and exact Replete equality\ncomplete provenance + replay" as Equality #E5DBFF
database "Semantic classes\nresolved BindingIdentity dependencies" as Classes #FFE8CC
rectangle "Resolved generations and kills\nunknown effects are barriers" as Transfer #FFF3BF
rectangle "Forward must-availability\ndeterministic fixed point" as Available #D3F9D8
rectangle "Backward must-anticipability\ndeterministic fixed point" as Busy #C3FAE8
rectangle "Dominance + explicit no-kill search\n<<decision>>" as Qualify #FFD8A8
rectangle "Advisory CSE candidates\nproducer + use + proof index" as Cse #D3F9D8
rectangle "Advisory PRE candidates\nplacement + occurrences + proofs" as Pre #C3FAE8
rectangle "Typed exclusion or completion limit\nabsence is inconclusive" as Limited #FFE3E3

Input -[#6741D9]-> Equality
Equality -[#C92A2A]-> Limited : unsupported / incomplete
Equality -[#E8590C]-> Classes : exact proof edges only
Classes -[#F08C00]-> Transfer
Transfer -[#2F9E44]-> Available
Transfer -[#0CA678]-> Busy
Available -[#F08C00]-> Qualify
Busy -[#F08C00]-> Qualify
Qualify -[#2F9E44]-> Cse : available + dominating producer
Qualify -[#0CA678]-> Pre : busy + common dominator
Qualify -[#C92A2A]-> Limited : cap / incomplete flow

note bottom of Qualify #FFF9DB
Equality is not a path fact.
Availability does not identify a producer.
Every reported candidate remains advisory.
end note

note bottom of Transfer #E7F5FF
Resolved definitions kill dependent classes.
Same spelling in a different scope does not.
Heap work queues keep depth off the native stack.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#D0EBFF>| immutable typed input |
|<#E5DBFF>| replayed equality evidence |
|<#FFE8CC>| canonical semantic identity |
|<#FFF3BF>| transfer evidence |
|<#D3F9D8>| forward-flow evidence / CSE |
|<#C3FAE8>| backward-flow evidence / PRE |
|<#FFD8A8>| composition decision |
|<#FFE3E3>| excluded or incomplete |
endlegend
@enduml
